Third-party material

Design values, icon SVGs, component renders (assets/icons, assets/kit-renders,
assets/brand) and page screenshots (references/screenshots) are derived from
"Smartisan OS UI Kit (Unofficial)" by Paix Chan
(https://www.figma.com/community/file/1419385240874679870), licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes: SVG ids made unique,
canvas backgrounds removed, two icon variants renamed to match their shape,
currentColor sprite added. That material remains under CC BY 4.0.

"Smartisan", "锤子", the T logo and Smartisan OS are trademarks or works of
their respective owners. This is an unofficial fan project and is not
